[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12181.19, "timestamp": "03:23:01", "text": "一，不。二、三、五。哦，就差一点点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12184.389, "timestamp": "03:23:04", "text": "我本来可以说六个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12186.469, "timestamp": "03:23:06", "text": "不，不。和上学期一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12188.63, "timestamp": "03:23:08", "text": "七个人，我设法发表了一篇论文。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12192.95, "timestamp": "03:23:12", "text": "现在。我的天哪。等等，你现在是哪一年？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12193.704, "timestamp": "03:23:13", "author": "@AerinViolet", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UKawanVvntNiAwz6RWv6wPk_S8YwApvPcCfLApO-du_RbQRIPGtzJ5FTt1DCNmZFJWc_2vxlqw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ssIfY7OFG5OykQOpn4CQCw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12195.75, "timestamp": "03:23:15", "text": "第二还是第三？三年级。呃，和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12198.15, "timestamp": "03:23:18", "text": "下个月就要考试了。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12199.59, "timestamp": "03:23:19", "text": "结束了，我即将完成三年级的学习。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12202.51, "timestamp": "03:23:22", "text": "即将进入最后一年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12204.99, "timestamp": "03:23:24", "text": "啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12208.87, "timestamp": "03:23:28", "text": "你好。太棒了。哦，你好。你好。如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12211.429, "timestamp": "03:23:31", "text": "你在做什么？ Warrior没有录制。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12213.99, "timestamp": "03:23:33", "text": "不想再活下去了。哦，我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12216.271, "timestamp": "03:23:36", "author": "@AerinViolet", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UKawanVvntNiAwz6RWv6wPk_S8YwApvPcCfLApO-du_RbQRIPGtzJ5FTt1DCNmZFJWc_2vxlqw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I am good"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12216.71, "timestamp": "03:23:36", "text": "知道与此相关的是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12218.389, "timestamp": "03:23:38", "text": "事件。大概两年左右吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12221.429, "timestamp": "03:23:41", "text": "或者别的什么。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12222.87, "timestamp": "03:23:42", "text": "因为你知道这不像你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12224.87, "timestamp": "03:23:44", "text": "你将学习一个概念"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12226.469, "timestamp": "03:23:46", "text": "在你整个大学期间。你就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12229.64, "timestamp": "03:23:49", "text": "学了一点这个那个。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12231.19, "timestamp": "03:23:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12232.87, "timestamp": "03:23:52", "text": "你知道吗？让我喜欢这个节目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12236.15, "timestamp": "03:23:56", "text": "你看到了我尝试过的所有方法。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12237.67, "timestamp": "03:23:57", "text": "是的，通过阅读相关资料你就知道了。"}]